# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Buildah (podman) does not re-include a file whose parent directory is
# excluded, so the packages the images build are named as directories too; see
# https://github.com/containers/buildah/issues/6417. The last matching rule
# wins, which is why the test-file exclusion is repeated after them. Docker
# produces the same context either way.
!api
!cmd
!internal
**/*_test.go
